// Isolated native-posix-files-x86_64 acceptance, not the historical Mode25
// corpus. Mode25 supplies boot/router machinery only. Test-control calls are
// private to this fixture. Four loaded principals exercise real CPL3/CR3,
// SYSCALL, fault-recovering copies and current-process native file authority.
// The fixed16MiB volume is a declared physical grant at64..80MiB in128MiB RAM.
// A supervisor RW/NX aperture exists ONLY during masked synchronous service
// operations. No extra mappings survive a user/scheduler return. No SMP claim.

